[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5034477914","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121563#issuecomment-5034477914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121563","id":5034477914,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLBQJWg","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T13:12:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T13:12:03Z","body":"It seems you've misinterpreted `PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.motion` to be relative to the passed `PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.transform`. But it's not relative/local to that transform, both `PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.motion` and `PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.transform` are expressed in the global physics space coordinates.\n\nSo if you'd want to query against a motion vector local to the passed transform for the given shape, you could do something like:\n```gdscript\nvar query := PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.new()\nquery.shape = ...\nquery.transform = ...\nquery.motion = query.transform.basis * local_motion\n```\n\nI don't see any bug in here, but the docs probably could/should be clarified.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5034477914/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5036640538","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121563#issuecomment-5036640538","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121563","id":5036640538,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLDUJGg","user":{"login":"QuirinusInvictus","id":93449411,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZHsww","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93449411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuirinusInvictus","html_url":"https://github.com/QuirinusInvictus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuirinusInvictus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuirinusInvictus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuirinusInvictus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuirinusInvictus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuirinusInvictus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuirinusInvictus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuirinusInvictus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuirinusInvictus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuirinusInvictus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T16:45:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T16:45:23Z","body":"Thanks a lot, but it is really confusing that you need to give it both transform and global motion. I feel the default should be local motion instead, considering it already calculates from the needed transform.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5036640538/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]